---
import DaymarkLayout from '../../layouts/DaymarkLayout.astro';
---

<DaymarkLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy — Daymark"
  description="Daymark is local-first and privacy-first. Zero servers, zero tracking. Read our full privacy policy."
>

  <div class="pp-hero">
    <div class="pp-hero-glow"></div>
    <div class="pp-hero-inner">
      <div class="pp-shield-wrap">
        <svg class="pp-shield-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
          <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="pp-date-badge">Effective Date: August 8, 2026</div>
      <h1 class="pp-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="pp-subtitle">Daymark was built on a single promise: <strong>your events never leave your device.</strong> No servers. No tracking. No compromises.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Zero Data Guarantee Callout -->
  <div class="pp-guarantee-wrap">
    <div class="pp-guarantee">
      <div class="pp-guarantee-icon">🔐</div>
      <div>
        <div class="pp-guarantee-title">Zero Data Guarantee</div>
        <div class="pp-guarantee-body">Daymark collects <strong>zero personal data</strong>. Events, background images, and settings are stored only in your browser — never transmitted, never logged, never sold.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content grid: TOC + Sections -->
  <div class="pp-layout">

    <!-- Sticky Table of Contents -->
    <aside class="pp-toc">
      <div class="pp-toc-card">
        <div class="pp-toc-title">Contents</div>
        <nav>
          <a href="#s1" class="pp-toc-link">1. Information Collection</a>
          <a href="#s2" class="pp-toc-link">2. Local Storage Model</a>
          <a href="#s3" class="pp-toc-link">3. Backup & Restore</a>
          <a href="#s4" class="pp-toc-link">4. No Analytics/Tracking</a>
          <a href="#s5" class="pp-toc-link">5. Third-Party Services</a>
          <a href="#s6" class="pp-toc-link">6. Policy Changes</a>
          <a href="#s7" class="pp-toc-link">7. Contact Us</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="pp-toc-footer">
          <a href="/daymark" class="pp-toc-back">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
            Back to Daymark
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <!-- Policy Sections -->
    <main class="pp-sections">

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section id="s1" class="pp-card pp-card-blue">
        <div class="pp-card-header">
          <div class="pp-card-icon pp-icon-blue">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 14.66V20a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5.34"/><polygon points="18 2 22 6 12 16 8 16 8 12 18 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="pp-card-title">1. Information Collection and Use</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="pp-text">Daymark operates on a <strong class="pp-highlight">local-first privacy model</strong>. Here is an exhaustive list of what we collect on our servers:</p>
        <div class="pp-none-box">
          <span class="pp-none-icon">∅</span>
          <span>Absolutely nothing.</span>
        </div>
        <p class="pp-text pp-text-sm">We do not collect, transmit, or process any personally identifiable information, browsing history, keystroke data, or analytics of any kind. No account creation is required to use Daymark.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section id="s2" class="pp-card pp-card-indigo">
        <div class="pp-card-header">
          <div class="pp-card-icon pp-icon-indigo">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M9 21V9"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="pp-card-title">2. Local Storage Model</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="pp-text">All data created by Daymark is stored exclusively inside your browser using built-in extension storage APIs:</p>
        <ul class="pp-list">
          <li><span class="pp-list-dot pp-dot-indigo"></span><span><strong>Event details</strong> — Title, target date, and time of your upcoming days.</span></li>
          <li><span class="pp-list-dot pp-dot-indigo"></span><span><strong>Visual styling</strong> — Custom colors, GIF URLs, or uploaded background images.</span></li>
          <li><span class="pp-list-dot pp-dot-indigo"></span><span><strong>Widget preferences</strong> — Visibility toggles and display settings.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="pp-text pp-text-sm">This data lives entirely within your browser's sandboxed storage. Uninstalling Daymark removes all data permanently.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section id="s3" class="pp-card pp-card-green">
        <div class="pp-card-header">
          <div class="pp-card-icon pp-icon-green">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="pp-card-title">3. Backup & Restore (Data Loss)</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="pp-text">Because your data is stored locally, it may be permanently lost if you clear your browser's local storage or uninstall the extension.</p>
        <p class="pp-text">We strongly encourage you to use the built-in <strong>Backup feature</strong> to export your events and settings to a secure file on your computer, which you can restore at any time.</p>
        <div class="pp-algo-box">
          <div class="pp-algo-label">Storage Responsibility</div>
          <div class="pp-algo-value">Your Device</div>
          <div class="pp-algo-note">Exported backup files remain under your sole control. We have no remote access to recover lost data.</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section id="s4" class="pp-card pp-card-neutral">
        <div class="pp-card-header">
          <div class="pp-card-icon pp-icon-neutral">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="12" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="pp-card-title">4. No Analytics or Tracking</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="pp-text">Daymark <strong>does not integrate</strong> with any tracking tools or servers. We have:</p>
        <ul class="pp-list">
          <li><span class="pp-list-dot pp-dot-neutral"></span><span>No analytics platforms (Google Analytics, Mixpanel, etc.)</span></li>
          <li><span class="pp-list-dot pp-dot-neutral"></span><span>No advertising networks or pixels</span></li>
          <li><span class="pp-list-dot pp-dot-neutral"></span><span>No background telemetry or usage profiling</span></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section id="s5" class="pp-card pp-card-neutral">
        <div class="pp-card-header">
          <div class="pp-card-icon pp-icon-neutral">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="12" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="pp-card-title">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="pp-text">Daymark may allow you to link to external URLs for GIF backgrounds. If you link to an external image URL, your browser will make a standard network request to fetch that image from the hosting provider, subject to their privacy policies. This is a standard browser behavior.</p>
        <p class="pp-text pp-text-sm">The browser infrastructure (e.g., Google Chrome Web Store) may collect basic technical information outside of our direct control, such as installation metrics.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section id="s6" class="pp-card pp-card-neutral">
        <div class="pp-card-header">
          <div class="pp-card-icon pp-icon-neutral">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="pp-card-title">6. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="pp-text">We may update this Privacy Policy as Daymark evolves. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated Effective Date. We will not retroactively reduce user privacy protections without explicit notice.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section id="s7" class="pp-card pp-card-neutral">
        <div class="pp-card-header">
          <div class="pp-card-icon pp-icon-neutral">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="pp-card-title">7. Contact Us</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="pp-text">Have questions about this Privacy Policy? Reach out via email:</p>
        <a href="mailto:karaleutkarsh3696@gmail.com" class="pp-contact-btn">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
          karaleutkarsh3696@gmail.com
        </a>
      </section>

    </main>
  </div>

</DaymarkLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .pp-hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 80px 24px 60px;
    text-align: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .pp-hero-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 600px; height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(59,130,246,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .pp-hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .pp-shield-wrap {
    width: 72px; height: 72px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(59,130,246,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.25);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .pp-shield-icon {
    width: 36px; height: 36px;
    color: #3b82f6;
  }
  .pp-date-badge {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #71717a;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid #3f3f46;
    background: rgba(39,39,42,0.6);
  }
  .pp-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #f4f4f5;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .pp-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #a1a1aa;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 540px;
  }
  .pp-subtitle strong { color: #3b82f6; }

  /* ── Zero Data Guarantee ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .pp-guarantee-wrap {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .pp-guarantee {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
    background: rgba(59,130,246,0.07);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.25);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
  }
  .pp-guarantee-icon { font-size: 28px; line-height: 1; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
  .pp-guarantee-title {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #3b82f6;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .pp-guarantee-body {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #a1a1aa;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .pp-guarantee-body strong { color: #f4f4f5; }

  /* ── Layout ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .pp-layout {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px 80px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (min-width: 800px) {
    .pp-layout { grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr; }
  }

  /* ── TOC ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .pp-toc { position: sticky; top: calc(64px + 24px); }
  .pp-toc-card {
    background: #27272a;
    border: 1px solid #3f3f46;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .pp-toc-title {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #71717a;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .pp-toc-link {
    display: block;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #a1a1aa;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .pp-toc-link:hover { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.1); color: #60a5fa; }
  .pp-toc-footer { margin-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #3f3f46; padding-top: 12px; }
  .pp-toc-back {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #71717a;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }
  .pp-toc-back:hover { color: #60a5fa; }

  /* ── Sections ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .pp-sections { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; }

  .pp-card {
    background: #27272a;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 28px 32px;
    border-left: 4px solid transparent;
    border-top: 1px solid #3f3f46;
    border-right: 1px solid #3f3f46;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #3f3f46;
    scroll-margin-top: calc(64px + 24px);
  }
  .pp-card-blue   { border-left-color: #3b82f6; }
  .pp-card-indigo { border-left-color: #6366f1; }
  .pp-card-green  { border-left-color: #4ade80; }
  .pp-card-neutral{ border-left-color: #52525b; }

  .pp-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .pp-card-icon {
    width: 40px; height: 40px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .pp-icon-blue    { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.12);  color: #3b82f6; }
  .pp-icon-indigo  { background: rgba(99,102,241,0.12); color: #6366f1; }
  .pp-icon-green   { background: rgba(74,222,128,0.12);  color: #4ade80; }
  .pp-icon-neutral { background: rgba(82,82,91,0.3);     color: #a1a1aa; }

  .pp-card-title {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #f4f4f5;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pp-text {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #a1a1aa;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .pp-text:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .pp-text strong { color: #f4f4f5; }
  .pp-text-sm { font-size: 13px; color: #71717a; margin-top: 14px; }
  .pp-highlight { color: #3b82f6 !important; }

  .pp-none-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    background: rgba(59,130,246,0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #60a5fa;
    margin: 14px 0;
  }
  .pp-none-icon { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; }

  .pp-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 14px 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .pp-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #a1a1aa;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .pp-list li strong { color: #f4f4f5; }
  .pp-list-dot {
    width: 7px; height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .pp-dot-indigo  { background: #6366f1; }
  .pp-dot-neutral { background: #52525b; }

  /* AES algo box */
  .pp-algo-box {
    background: #18181b;
    border: 1px solid #3f3f46;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .pp-algo-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #71717a;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .pp-algo-value {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #60a5fa;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }
  .pp-algo-note {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #71717a;
    margin-top: 6px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Contact */
  .pp-contact-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #f4f4f5;
    text-decoration: none;
    background: #18181b;
    border: 1px solid #3f3f46;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }
  .pp-contact-btn:hover { border-color: #60a5fa; color: #60a5fa; }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
    .pp-date-badge {
      color: #52525b;
      border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
      background: rgba(244, 244, 245, 0.8);
    }
    .pp-shield-wrap { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.05); border-color: rgba(59,130,246,0.2); }
    .pp-title { color: #18181b; }
    .pp-subtitle { color: #52525b; }
    .pp-guarantee { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.04); border-color: rgba(59,130,246,0.2); }
    .pp-guarantee-body { color: #52525b; }
    .pp-guarantee-body strong { color: #18181b; }
    .pp-toc-card { background: #fff; border-color: #e4e4e7; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    .pp-toc-title { color: #71717a; }
    .pp-toc-link { color: #52525b; }
    .pp-toc-link:hover { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.1); color: #2563eb; }
    .pp-toc-footer { border-color: #e4e4e7; }
    .pp-toc-back { color: #71717a; }
    .pp-toc-back:hover { color: #2563eb; }
    .pp-card { background: #fff; border-color: #e4e4e7; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    .pp-card-title { color: #18181b; }
    .pp-text { color: #52525b; }
    .pp-text strong { color: #18181b; }
    .pp-text-sm { color: #71717a; }
    .pp-none-box { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.05); border-color: rgba(59,130,246,0.2); color: #2563eb; }
    .pp-algo-box { background: #fff; border-color: #e4e4e7; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    .pp-algo-label { color: #71717a; }
    .pp-algo-note { color: #71717a; }
    .pp-algo-value { color: #2563eb; }
    .pp-contact-btn { background: #fff; border-color: #e4e4e7; color: #18181b; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    .pp-list li { color: #52525b; }
    .pp-list li strong { color: #18181b; }
    .pp-icon-neutral { background: rgba(82,82,91,0.08); color: #52525b; }
  }
</style>
